# Same convention as elements3/: done-markers are run state, not record. They tell a
# detached run's dead shell that it finished; tracking them makes a rerun show a phantom
# deletion in the shared tree's porcelain, and a committed marker asserts "this finished"
# about a run that may be mid-flight. The logs beside them are the record.
*.DONE

# Tables generated on a SMOKE domain are not campaign artifacts and must not sit here
# looking like ones. The real tables arrive with domains derived from each species pair's
# own curve; anything named smoke_* was generated on an invented domain to exercise the
# instrument and is deliberately not kept.
smoke_*.tbl
